{"title": "写入调整：vda 成功，loop 被拒", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "echo 512 > /sys/block/vda/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "cat /sys/block/vda/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "512"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "echo 256 > /sys/block/vda/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "vda 调到 512 生效，读回确认后恢复默认 256"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "echo 256 > /sys/block/loop5/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "echo: write error: Invalid argument"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "cat /sys/block/loop5/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "128"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "loop 盘调大被内核拒绝且原值不变。实测 Rocky 9.3 容器"}
]}
